sequenceDiagram
  actor Buyer as Buyer UI
  participant API as FastAPI API
  participant PG as PostgreSQL
  participant WS as WebSocket (/ws)

  Buyer->>+API: POST /chat/sessions (productId)
  API->>+PG: Get/create session (product_id, buyer_id)
  PG-->>-API: ChatSession row
  API-->>-Buyer: 201 Session DTO

  Buyer->>+API: GET /chat/sessions
  API->>+PG: Query sessions & unread counts
  PG-->>-API: Ordered session list
  API-->>-Buyer: 200 Sessions (UI groups by peer)

  Buyer->>+API: POST /chat/sessions/{id}/messages (clientMsgId)
  API->>+PG: Check participant & (sender_id, client_msg_id)
  alt New message
    PG-->>-API: Commit ChatMessage row
    PG-)WS: 0.5s PG cursor poll + token recheck -> MESSAGE_CREATED
    API-->>Buyer: 201 Message DTO
  else Same clientMsgId & payload
    API->>+PG: Fetch persisted row
    PG-->>-API: Existing ChatMessage
    API-->>Buyer: 200 Idempotent replay
  else Same clientMsgId, edited payload
    API-->>-Buyer: 409 MESSAGE_ID_CONFLICT
  end
